 "_doc": "Madibeng LM (Brits / Hartbeespoort) 'Belastingfaktuur / Tax Invoice' with Account and Invoice Detail lines (date, description, meter, prev, current, tariff code, factor, units, AMOUNT ex VAT, VAT, TOTAL; credits as '123.45 -' or '123.45-'), two prints (5 bills each) that differ only in spacing and the ageing block. Electricity = the 'KVA BULK ...' line pair with an EL tariff code: the line with two non-zero readings is kWh (-> standard), the line with a zero reading is kVA demand (-> demand); 'KVA SERVICE CHARGE' -> other. Deposit guarantee and reading period print on 6 bills (garbled on the rest; read_end falls back to the kWh line date). Fingerprint: own VAT number + name. IDENTITY x_elec_ex_id = ageing AMOUNT - BALANCE B/FWD - all non-electricity lines incl. receipts: 0.00 on 10/10. 10 bills checked; the Aug-2025 bill prints its kWh readings swapped (current lower than previous; consumption = the difference) and is flagged READ-down as printed.",
